WEBVTT

sub1
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.000
<v Anna>Good morning from the harbour.

sub2
00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:16.880
<v Anna>The sea is calm
and the sky is clear.

sub3
00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:19.960
<v Ben>The first ferry left
at seven o'clock.

sub4
00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:23.440 line:0
<i>(gulls calling)</i>

sub5
00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:27.320
<v Anna>Wind from the north-west,
about ten knots.

sub6
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.400
<v Ben><c.yellow>Fog may form</c>
<c.yellow>near the lighthouse.</c>

sub7
00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:33.880
<v Anna>Fishing boats return
before noon.

sub8
00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:37.760 line:0
<i>(engine starts)</i>

sub9
00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:40.840
<v Ben>The fish market opens
at half past eight.

sub10
00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:44.320
<v Anna>Water temperature
is twelve degrees.

sub11
00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:48.200
<v Ben>Tide tables are <b>on the <u>board</u></b>

sub12
00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:51.280
<v Anna>High tide at 14:20.

sub13
00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:54.760
<v Ben>Low tide at 20:35.

sub14
00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:58.640
<v Anna>Rain is likely
after six this evening.

sub15
00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:01.720 line:0
<i>(bell rings)</i>

sub16
00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:05.200
<v Ben>The harbour office
closes at five.

sub17
00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:09.080
<v Anna><c.yellow>Small boats should</c>
<c.yellow>stay inside the wall.</c>

sub18
00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:12.160
<v Ben>Tomorrow starts
cold and bright.

sub19
00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:15.640
<v Anna>That is all
from the harbour.

sub20
00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:19.520 line:0
<i>(music)</i>
